 "name": "evsoc_stellantis_ecmp",
 "description": "Stellantis e-CMP / STLA Small and the electric vans (K9: e-Doblo, e-Berlingo, e-Partner, Combo-e; EMP2/eK9: e-Ulysse, e-Traveller, Vivaro-e ...). BMU 6B4 -> 694. SoC/voltage derived from a Corsa-e capture and cross-checked; SoH, current and energy after OVMS (e-Doblo, MIT) and WiCAN (e-Ulysse). The formulas match the workshop data in PSA-RE (BMU_CTE1). Battery temperature min/max/mean (22D87D, 22D817, 22D877, each A-40) after PSA-RE, experimental: not checked on any car. The plug-in hybrids (evsoc_stellantis_phev) answer at the same address with a different scaling; they are told apart by the length of the answer to 22D860 (3 bytes here).",
